{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T15:21:20.930Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9d7f970542d8df5a0a6bdb3b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-gh1729"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-1729: the extension test harness passes a compact output_format receipt that the native CLI refuses with extension_read_output_invalid since 2026.11.13"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"GH-1729 (filed 2026-11-14, reproduced on the 2026.11.7, 2026.11.13 and 2026.11.14 artifacts). An extension command declares read_output { row_keys: [\"rows\"] } and an output_format service returns a compact receipt ({ ok: true, output: \"receipt.md\" }). The native CLI on 2026.11.13 and 2026.11.14 refuses the receipt-only handler result with exit 2 and extension_read_output_invalid before the formatter receipt, while the same result with a rows array passes. createExtensionTestHarness().runCommand() handles both, so a package author cannot detect the native refusal before adoption; 2026.11.7 accepted both. Expected from the issue: make native output admission testable through the public harness, or document that the harness validates only the handler result and requires a packed native probe; if declared row keys are intentionally mandatory before custom formatting, document the compatible compact receipt pattern and migration. Malformed and oversized output must stay refused. Duplicate check: searched extension read_output row_keys output_format receipt harness native refusal; no open item."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["extensions","gh:1729","read-output","sdk","testing"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-14T15:21:20.930Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T15:21:20.930Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":150},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A regression fixture distinguishes receipt-only output, valid rows with compact formatter output, malformed rows and oversized delivered output across the native CLI and the test harness; Package authors can detect the native refusal before adoption, either through the harness or a documented packed-native probe; Valid compact output stays compact and malformed or oversized output stays refused"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-ugqx"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reporter","value":"unbraind"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"The harness and the native CLI agree on whether a compact formatter receipt is admitted"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"The harness passes a receipt that the native CLI refuses with extension_read_output_invalid"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"77365db9594368d10013706717bb3d6896747d057a45f5d519ce7a655d1035fc","item_hash_version":3,"message":"File GH-1729","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash"