{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T20:53:38.046Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"dec610b5c29dc08047ecfcc1","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-14T20:53:38.045Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Codex review round 7 (head 6c9fe839a), one P2 finding, verified and fixed: harness output hooks lacked the portable workspace coordinates (source_workspace_root, repo_root, pm_root_rel) that native runActiveCommandHandler resolves with resolvePortableWorkspaceContext, so a service keyed on them supplied rows natively but not in the harness. The harness now resolves them into the handler context (as native dispatch does for the handler too), and the command-result override and output_format service inherit them."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T20:53:38.046Z"}],"before_hash":"5188c44f5032a9e92e3d96bbe3332a58702c18b9a6dc6e14b9679c1b06080c92","after_hash":"ef7d3f9187ab2fee901858a91a4a6de60af700409139090cdac82be9abcbb250","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"09f102ccfb2a9eb6ce9e05ecd92bd85633be0ec857cd3536fdf5397775995c3b"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T21:28:23.869Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"dec610b5c29dc08047ecfcc1","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/5","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-14T21:28:23.869Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Codex review round 9 (head 44fa876c9) found one more replicated-stage edge (the fallback encoding ignored defaultOutputFormat). After nine rounds each found one more native output stage the harness copy missed, the design was changed so parity holds by construction: admitRegisteredReadOutputResult now runs native formatOutput on the printResult projection inside runWithIsolatedExtensionRuntime, with the activation's commands, services and registrations installed and the CLI's command context set, instead of re-implementing projection, overrides, services, encoding and payload. The replicated helpers are removed (net code reduction); every case from rounds 1-9 is covered in harness-parity.spec and passes through the native path."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T21:28:23.869Z"}],"before_hash":"ef7d3f9187ab2fee901858a91a4a6de60af700409139090cdac82be9abcbb250","after_hash":"3a6633b478610289f47b74286a0227cdc82e0bbf434ee3ccd1f0c3d3abe2d031","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"b4ca17523d439f244fb79dddd2fbb43cfb91c5b3a28ac979cef933bd9df66316"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T21:36:09.539Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"dec610b5c29dc08047ecfcc1","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/6","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-14T21:36:09.538Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Codex review round 10 (head 35a0623a7), three P2 findings, verified and fixed: (1) native delivery can set process.exitCode (an oversized output_format string under --output-budget 400 exits 2); the harness now saves and restores it around formatOutput so a passing package test cannot leak a failing exit code. (2) the isolated runtime left renderers null, so a JSON renderer that serializes BigInts worked natively but threw in the harness; the activation now attaches its renderer registry and the harness installs it with setActiveExtensionRenderers. (3, pm-gh1726 seam) a negated spelling of a repeatable boolean ({ 'no-many': [true, true] }) was refused although CLI --no-many --no-many gives [false, false]; list declarations now invert entry by entry, an empty optional array stays [], and a non-boolean entry is still refused."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T21:36:09.539Z"}],"before_hash":"3a6633b478610289f47b74286a0227cdc82e0bbf434ee3ccd1f0c3d3abe2d031","after_hash":"3cb84d4d727f9550aa9595ef48514eb3dc8f9619e816dbc077efb66df8744591","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"1245ac270034a6ee96ffbf1778734783cc9510ae879d1ea510b0b8c7d364385b"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T22:05:19.727Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"dec610b5c29dc08047ecfcc1","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/contract_change/migrate","value":"A command that renders a compact receipt keeps returning its declared rows (an empty collection is valid) and lets its output_format service render the receipt; package tests that pass an outputBudget their output cannot fit now expect output_budget_exceeded"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/contract_change/after","value":"The harness runs a handled read-output result through native formatOutput (receipt projection, command-result overrides, suppressed host output, output_format services, renderers and encoding resolution apply as natively) and throws extension_read_output_invalid for missing declared rows and output_budget_exceeded (exit 2) when the delivered output cannot fit the requested budget; process.exitCode is left untouched"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/contract_change/before","value":"The harness returned handled: true for a result missing its declared row collections, which the native CLI refuses with extension_read_output_invalid before formatting, and for output that cannot fit a requested outputBudget, which the native CLI omits with exit 2"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/contract_change/api","value":"runRegisteredCommandForTest and createExtensionTestHarness().runCommand for commands that declare read_output"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T22:05:19.727Z"}],"before_hash":"3cb84d4d727f9550aa9595ef48514eb3dc8f9619e816dbc077efb66df8744591","aft